          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says, “I have something to say about Israel's neighbours who have ruined the land I gave to my people Israel. I will take those wicked people away from their countries like an uprooted plant, and I will rescue Judah from them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But after I have taken them away, I will have mercy on them; I will bring each nation back to its own land and to its own country. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If with all their hearts they will accept the religion of my people and will swear, ‘As the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " lives’ — as they once taught my people to swear by Baal — then they will also be a part of my people and will prosper. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if any nation will not obey, then I will completely uproot it and destroy it. I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
